# Frontend Environment Configuration for Lockship

# Base URL of Lockship Backend REST API (e.g. https://api.lockship.vn/api or /api if reverse-proxied)
# Note: On HTTPS production, insecure http:// is automatically upgraded to prevent Mixed Content.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# Base URL of Lockship Socket.IO Realtime Server (e.g. https://api.lockship.vn or wss://api.lockship.vn)
# Note: If omitted, automatically resolved from VITE_API_BASE_URL origin.
VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:5000